<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FBF7F1', padding: '20px 64px' }}>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16, height: 100, borderBottom: '2px solid #E4D8C8' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 48, background: '#B07A4F', borderRadius: 3 }} />
    <Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2A211A' }}>e）项目心得</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#8A7B6B', marginTop: 4 }}>从真实交付链路中沉淀的全栈经验</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ marginLeft: 'auto', fontSize: 16, color: '#B0A18F', letterSpacing: 2 }}>REFLECTION</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 40, marginTop: 22, height: 518 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: '58%', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 15 }}>
      {[
        { t: '前后端契约先行', d: '以统一响应 {code,data,msg} 与 API 清单为契约，前后台并行开发互不阻塞' },
        { t: '工程化降低门槛', d: 'Swagger 自动文档 + 标准化启动脚本，运营与新人可快速上手' },
        { t: '问题驱动设计', d: '先定位"展示单一 / 后台低效 / 无统一入口"痛点，再决定功能边界' },
        { t: '工具赋能效率', d: '用 WordBuddy 完成需求拆解与代码生成，把时间留给架构与打磨' },
        { t: '持续打磨细节', d: '从 UIUX 令牌到 RBAC 权限，细节决定交付物是否"真正可用"' },
      ].map((it, i) => (
        <Box key={i} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, alignItems: 'flex-start', background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 12, padding: '13px 18px', boxShadow: '0 2px 10px rgba(42,33,26,0.05)' }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 34, height: 34, borderRadius: 9, background: '#2A211A', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center', flexShrink: 0, marginTop: 2 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>{i + 1}</Text>
          </Box>
          <Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2A211A' }}>{it.t}</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8A7B6B', marginTop: 2, lineHeight: 1.45 }}>{it.d}</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
      ))}
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ width: '42%', background: 'linear-gradient(160deg, #2A211A, #4A3A2C)', borderRadius: 18, padding: 36, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      <FAIcon name='quote-left' style={{ fill: '#C76B3A', width: 44, height: 44 }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 18 }}>
        把"能跑通"做成"能用"，才是全栈项目的真正交付。
      </Text>
      <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 5, background: '#C76B3A', borderRadius: 3, marginTop: 22 }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#CDBBA8', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 18 }}>
        从一份 PRD 到三位一体的可运行工程，最大的收获不是会用某个框架，而是学会用工程化思维拆解需求、用契约约束协作、用细节兑现体验。
      </Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 20, left: 64, right: 64, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#9A8B79' }}>暖禾家具 · 项目成果展示</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#9A8B79' }}>07 / 08</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
